{"title":"Four Fours/88","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Problem\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Problem</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Solution_1\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 1</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Solution_2\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 2</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#Solution_3\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 3</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-5\"><a href=\"#Solution_4\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">5</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 4</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-6\"><a href=\"#Solution_5\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">6</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 5</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-7\"><a href=\"#Solution_6\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">7</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 6</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-8\"><a href=\"#Solution_7\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">8</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 7</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-9\"><a href=\"#Solution_8\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">9</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 8</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Four_Fours/88&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>How to use four <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/7/c/c7cab1a05e1e0c1d51a6a219d96577a16b7abf9d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$4$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />s to get to <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/0/d/40d924a5d0ade21a3824a7f0343f8beae70ef96e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$88$\" width=\"17\" height=\"12\" />?\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_1\">Solution 1</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Four_Fours/88&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 1\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/f/9/ff9f62cbde130d030e6399e4152b37b3032e9d32.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{44 + 44 = 88}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -8px\" width=\"114\" height=\"26\" />\n</p><p>~anabel.disher\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_2\">Solution 2</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Four_Fours/88&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 2\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/8/2/482b0fba62fc7502e8b9fb930374b8f096a3a940.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$4! = 24$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"56\" height=\"13\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/4/1/541f4f0ac5c46d4e572ab6d69e704f8ad1810583.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$4 \\times 4 = 16$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"82\" height=\"13\" />, so:\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/2/c/d2c1e7f84b39c72afa42ac6b50fef91762c27ec8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{4! \\times 4 - 4! + 4 \\times 4 = 88}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -8px\" width=\"200\" height=\"27\" />\n</p><p>~anabel.disher\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_3\">Solution 3</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Four_Fours/88&amp;action=edit&amp;section=4\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 3\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/2/f/62f48c3b429fb2ed80e776dc39719784c72a6ec2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$4 + 4 = 8$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"76\" height=\"15\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/7/8/c78405136e9dc0696efac30ed6451e5f1e395b29.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$!4 + \\sqrt{4} = 9 + 2 = 11$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"170\" height=\"21\" />, so:\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/f/8/4f8f6dab88e13835eafacbc5cdc83b5aeac66e86.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{(4 + 4) \\times (!4 + \\sqrt{4}) = 88}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -11px\" width=\"207\" height=\"35\" />\n</p><p>~anabel.disher\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_4\">Solution 4</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Four_Fours/88&amp;action=edit&amp;section=5\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 4\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/1/d/f1d4690fc73f720753c6bbd833077959d777b8d5.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$4 - \\sqrt{4} = 4 - 2 = 2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"155\" height=\"21\" />, so:\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/e/3/6e390348efd1bcf791295a8e335c02559d5f3708.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{44 \\times (4 - \\sqrt{4}) = 88}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -11px\" width=\"166\" height=\"35\" />\n</p><p>~anabel.disher\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_5\">Solution 5</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Four_Fours/88&amp;action=edit&amp;section=6\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 5\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/7/f/17f68735e6174df664ed63d13203d0014a9318a2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$4! - 4 + \\sqrt{4} = 24 - 4 + 2 = 22$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"241\" height=\"21\" />, so:\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/a/a/2aa3297efce17c7616a3db72239b9ae5ca100a32.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{4 \\times (4! - 4 + \\sqrt{4}) = 88}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -11px\" width=\"193\" height=\"35\" />\n</p><p>~anabel.disher\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_6\">Solution 6</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Four_Fours/88&amp;action=edit&amp;section=7\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 6\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/7/6/f7698a3f9be9c1b3fe122d76f0ab6a65b8ebc627.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$!4 = 9$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"49\" height=\"14\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/2/5/625885b53be76678065cd8de7fa159e040ebe848.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\sqrt{4} = 2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"57\" height=\"18\" />, so:\n</p><p><span style=\"color:red\">$\\boxed{!4 \\times !4 + !4 - \\sqrt{4} = 88$ (Error compiling LaTeX. Unknown error_msg)</span>\n</p><p>~anabel.disher\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_7\">Solution 7</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Four_Fours/88&amp;action=edit&amp;section=8\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 7\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/8/2/482b0fba62fc7502e8b9fb930374b8f096a3a940.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$4! = 24$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"56\" height=\"13\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/c/e/bce51579c9a4b7fa03c77c3eda587c45f3c668db.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$24 \\times 4 = 96$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"94\" height=\"15\" />, so:\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/6/4/b64b853288b0c572b6835eb0cb48931b5aaa7d40.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{4! \\times 4 - 4 - 4 = 88}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -8px\" width=\"164\" height=\"27\" />\n</p><p>~anabel.disher\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_8\">Solution 8</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Four_Fours/88&amp;action=edit&amp;section=9\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 8\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/8/2/482b0fba62fc7502e8b9fb930374b8f096a3a940.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$4! = 24$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"56\" height=\"13\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/1/3/013039e44f0037d22097b5f5a118aa0c195b56e6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$4^{3} = 64$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"61\" height=\"17\" />, so:\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/1/a/21a9cc3d83f372532ed6970a3f8e3323f8c862c9.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{4! + \\frac{4^{4}}{4} = 64}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -19px\" width=\"112\" height=\"52\" />\n</p><p>~anabel.disher\n</p>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261018084929\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [show‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.021 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.691 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 130/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 0/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 0/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 2/100\nExpensive parser functio